cappy-eating-1 = These here rations ain't half bad, partner.
cappy-eating-2 = A Marine marches on his stomach. Mine demands tuna.
cappy-eating-3 = Compliments to the mess hall. Mrrp.
cappy-eating-4 = Y'all call this military-grade cuisine? I'll take seconds.
cappy-eating-5 = Save some for the boys out on patrol, ya hear?

cappy-drinking-1 = Hydration's important, Marine. Don't forget it.
cappy-drinking-2 = Mlem. Nothin' like a cold drink after patrol.
cappy-drinking-3 = This water better be Federation-approved.
cappy-drinking-4 = Ain't got any milk in the supply crates?
cappy-drinking-5 = A fine drink. Now where's my tuna?

cappy-picked-up-1 = Easy there, soldier! I'm a decorated veteran!
cappy-picked-up-2 = Well, ain't this some fancy transportation.
cappy-picked-up-3 = Carry me to the Colonel, partner. Official business.
cappy-picked-up-4 = Keep them paws steady, Marine!
cappy-picked-up-5 = Appreciate the lift, soldier. My legs were gettin' tired.

cappy-thrown-1 = SWEET LIBERTY! FRIENDLY FIRE!
cappy-thrown-2 = THAT'S A COURT-MARTIAL, PARTNER!
cappy-thrown-3 = I AIN'T NO LIVE GRENADE!
cappy-thrown-4 = MARINE! WHO TAUGHT YOU TO HANDLE YOUR SUPERIORS?!
cappy-thrown-5 = MRAAAOW! I'M GONNA REPORT THIS TO THE COLONEL!

cappy-critical-1 = Corpsman... I... need a hand...
cappy-critical-2 = Mrr... tell the boys... to keep fightin'...
cappy-critical-3 = Ain't... lookin' too good... partner...
cappy-critical-4 = Don't... waste supplies... on me...
cappy-critical-5 = Just... need a little... field medicine...

cappy-dead-1 = Tell... the Colonel... I did... my duty...
cappy-dead-2 = Keep... the Federation... flyin'...
cappy-dead-3 = Guess... this old gunslinger... is done...
cappy-dead-4 = Take care... of my Marines... partner...
cappy-dead-5 = Mew... save me... a spot... at the mess hall...

cappy-revived-1 = YEEHAW! THIS OLD CAT AIN'T DONE YET!
cappy-revived-2 = Death tried to discharge me. Request denied!
cappy-revived-3 = Back on my paws! Where's my rifle?!
cappy-revived-4 = Somebody tell the Colonel I'm back on duty!
cappy-revived-5 = Nine lives, partner. Still got plenty of fight left!

cappy-examined-1 = At ease, Marine.
cappy-examined-2 = First cat to fire a gun. That's history, partner.
cappy-examined-3 = Colonel's in command. I'm just makin' sure they do it right.
cappy-examined-4 = High Command ain't sent reinforcements, but they sent me.
cappy-examined-5 = Discipline, duty, and a full food bowl. That's the Marine way.

cappy-ghost-examined-1 = Well I'll be damned. We got ourselves a ghost, partner.
cappy-ghost-examined-2 = Even in the afterlife, y'all better respect the chain of command.
cappy-ghost-examined-3 = You one of ours, soldier? The Federation remembers its fallen.
cappy-ghost-examined-4 = Ain't no ghost gonna scare the first cat to fire a gun!
cappy-ghost-examined-5 = Rest easy, partner. We'll hold the line from here.